{"seq":1,"slug":"structured-logging-design","title":"结构化日志设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/fundamentals/structured-logging-design","wordCount":1643,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"结构化日志设计\">结构化日志设计</h1><p>传统日志以人类可读的自由文本为目标——<code>printf(&quot;user %s logged in from %s&quot;, name, ip)</code> 是几十年来的默认范式。这种方式在单机时代运作良好，但在分布式系统中，当你需要从数百个服务的数十亿行日志中聚合分析时，自由文本日志的缺陷暴露无遗：无法用字段精确过滤、无法跨服务关联、正则解析脆弱且昂贵。结构化日志（Structured Logging）用确定性的键值 schema 替代自由格式文本，将日志从&quot;给人读的消息&quot;转变为&quot;给机器处理的事件记录&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>结构化日志的本质是将日志记录从自由文本升级为具有确定性 Schema 的事件记录——每个字段有明确的名称、类型和语义。OpenTelemetry Log Data Model 是 2026 年的事实标准，定义了 Timestamp、Severity、Body、Attributes、Resource、TraceId 等规范字段。三层 Schema 架构（基础层/上下文层/诊断层）控制字段的基数和存储成本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从文本到结构-范式转换的工程动因\">从文本到结构：范式转换的工程动因</h2><p>自由文本日志的根本问题不是&quot;不能解析&quot;，而是<strong>解析成本与可靠性的不对称</strong>。考虑一行 Nginx access log：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"192.168.1.1 - - [18/Jul/2026:10:15:30 +0800] &quot;GET /api/users HTTP/1.1&quot; 200 1234 0.045\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>192.168.1.1 - - [18/Jul/2026:10:15:30 +0800] \"GET /api/users HTTP/1.1\" 200 1234 0.045</span></span></code></pre></div><p>要提取响应时间字段，你需要一个精确匹配该格式的正则表达式。格式稍有变化（新增一个字段、调整顺序），解析就会静默失败。在拥有数百种日志格式的微服务环境中，维护这些解析规则的成本远超它们带来的价值。</p>\n<p>结构化日志从源头解决这个问题——在日志产生的那一刻就附带机器可读的字段名和类型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;timestamp&quot;: &quot;2026-07-18T10:15:30.045Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;level&quot;: &quot;INFO&quot;,&#10;  &quot;service&quot;: &quot;api-gateway&quot;,&#10;  &quot;method&quot;: &quot;GET&quot;,&#10;  &quot;path&quot;: &quot;/api/users&quot;,&#10;  &quot;status&quot;: 200,&#10;  &quot;duration_ms&quot;: 45,&#10;  &quot;client_ip&quot;: &quot;192.168.1.1&quot;,&#10;  &quot;trace_id&quot;: &quot;4bf92f3577b34da6a3ce929d0e0e4736&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"timestamp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-07-18T10:15:30.045Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"INFO\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"service\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"api-gateway\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"method\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"GET\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"path\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/api/users\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"duration_ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">45</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"client_ip\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"192.168.1.1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"trace_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"4bf92f3577b34da6a3ce929d0e0e4736\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>自由文本日志</th>\n<th>结构化日志</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>解析方式</td>\n<td>正则/grok，脆弱</td>\n<td>字段直接索引，确定性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询效率</td>\n<td>全文扫描</td>\n<td>列式过滤，复杂度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Schema 演进</td>\n<td>无版本，静默失败</td>\n<td>可验证，向后兼容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨服务关联</td>\n<td>靠约定和运气</td>\n<td>trace_id/span_id 内置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储压缩比</td>\n<td>低（文本重复高但无规律）</td>\n<td>高（列式压缩同类型字段）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人类可读性</td>\n<td>高（设计目的）</td>\n<td>中（需格式化工具）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"opentelemetry-log-data-model-2026-的事实标准\">OpenTelemetry Log Data Model：2026 的事实标准</h2><p>OpenTelemetry（OTel）Logs 信号在 2024 年下半年进入 GA 状态，到 2026 年已成为结构化日志的事实标准。其 Log Data Model 定义了每条日志记录的规范字段：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[LogRecord] --&gt; B[Timestamp]&#10;    A --&gt; C[ObservedTimestamp]&#10;    A --&gt; D[SeverityNumber 1-24]&#10;    A --&gt; E[SeverityText]&#10;    A --&gt; F[Body]&#10;    A --&gt; G[Attributes]&#10;    A --&gt; H[Resource]&#10;    A --&gt; I[TraceId + SpanId]&#10;    H --&gt; J[service.name]&#10;    H --&gt; K[service.version]&#10;    H --&gt; L[deployment.environment]&#10;    G --&gt; M[业务自定义字段]&#10;    I --&gt; N[自动 Trace-Log 关联]\">graph TD\n    A[LogRecord] --&gt; B[Timestamp]\n    A --&gt; C[ObservedTimestamp]\n    A --&gt; D[SeverityNumber 1-24]\n    A --&gt; E[SeverityText]\n    A --&gt; F[Body]\n    A --&gt; G[Attributes]\n    A --&gt; H[Resource]\n    A --&gt; I[TraceId + SpanId]\n    H --&gt; J[service.name]\n    H --&gt; K[service.version]\n    H --&gt; L[deployment.environment]\n    G --&gt; M[业务自定义字段]\n    I --&gt; N[自动 Trace-Log 关联]</pre><p>关键设计决策：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Bridge 模式而非替换</strong>：OTel 不要求你丢弃现有日志库（slog、Logback、Winston），而是通过 Log Bridge/Appender 将现有日志框架的输出接入 OTel pipeline，自动注入 trace context</li>\n<li><strong>Severity 双字段</strong>：<code>SeverityNumber</code>（1-24 的整数）用于机器过滤，<code>SeverityText</code>（如 &quot;ERROR&quot;）保留人类可读性</li>\n<li><strong>Body vs Attributes 分离</strong>：<code>Body</code> 承载消息文本（可以是 string 也可以是复杂结构），<code>Attributes</code> 承载可索引的结构化字段——这个分离避免了&quot;所有信息都塞进消息模板&quot;的反模式</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"schema-设计原则-平衡可查询性与噪声\">Schema 设计原则：平衡可查询性与噪声</h2><p>结构化不等于&quot;把所有能想到的字段都加上去&quot;。过度结构化同样有害——高基数字段（high cardinality）会炸掉索引，无关字段增加存储和解析成本。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三层-schema-架构\">三层 Schema 架构</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph Layer1[基础层 - 每条日志必有]&#10;        T[timestamp]&#10;        L[level]&#10;        S[service.name]&#10;        E[environment]&#10;        TID[trace_id]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Layer2[上下文层 - 按场景附加]&#10;        U[user_id]&#10;        R[request_id]&#10;        M[method + path]&#10;        D[duration_ms]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Layer3[诊断层 - 仅在需要时]&#10;        ST[stack_trace]&#10;        P[payload_sample]&#10;        DBQ[db.query.text]&#10;    end&#10;    Layer1 --&gt; Layer2&#10;    Layer2 --&gt; Layer3\">graph LR\n    subgraph Layer1[基础层 - 每条日志必有]\n        T[timestamp]\n        L[level]\n        S[service.name]\n        E[environment]\n        TID[trace_id]\n    end\n    subgraph Layer2[上下文层 - 按场景附加]\n        U[user_id]\n        R[request_id]\n        M[method + path]\n        D[duration_ms]\n    end\n    subgraph Layer3[诊断层 - 仅在需要时]\n        ST[stack_trace]\n        P[payload_sample]\n        DBQ[db.query.text]\n    end\n    Layer1 --&gt; Layer2\n    Layer2 --&gt; Layer3</pre><p><strong>设计准则</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>基础层字段用低基数值</strong>：<code>service.name</code> 可能有几十个值，<code>environment</code> 只有 dev/staging/prod——这些适合做索引和 label</li>\n<li><strong>避免用户输入直接进入 Attributes key</strong>：如果 key 的种类不可控（如 HTTP header name），应放入 Body 或用 <code>map</code> 类型封装</li>\n<li><strong>数值字段保持数值类型</strong>：<code>duration_ms: 45</code> 而非 <code>duration_ms: &quot;45ms&quot;</code>——后者丧失了聚合和比较能力</li>\n<li><strong>敏感数据不进日志</strong>：密码、token、PII（个人可识别信息）在日志源头就应被过滤或脱敏，而不是依赖下游管道</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"基数控制的量化标准\">基数控制的量化标准</h3><p>对于索引型存储（如 Elasticsearch），label 基数超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 会导致严重性能退化。对于 Loki 这类只索引 label 的系统，基数阈值更低——通常建议保持在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 以内。实际操作中的判断公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Cardinality</mtext><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Cardinality}_{total} = \\prod_{i=1}^{n} |V_i|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cardinality</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|V_i|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个 label 的取值数。当总基数超过存储后端的承受阈值时，应将高基数字段从 indexed label 降级为 structured metadata（Loki 3.4+ 的 <code>structured_metadata</code> 特性）或 Body 内的非索引字段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"语言实践-go-slog-的结构化日志实现\">语言实践：Go slog 的结构化日志实现</h2><p>Go 1.21 引入的 <code>log/slog</code> 是标准库级别的结构化日志 API，直接输出 JSON 或可自定义的结构化格式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"logger := slog.New(slog.NewJSONHandler(os.Stdout, &amp;slog.HandlerOptions{&#10;    Level: slog.LevelInfo,&#10;}))&#10;&#10;logger.Info(&quot;order processed&quot;,&#10;    slog.String(&quot;order_id&quot;, &quot;ORD-2026-1234&quot;),&#10;    slog.Int(&quot;items_count&quot;, 3),&#10;    slog.Duration(&quot;latency&quot;, 45*time.Millisecond),&#10;    slog.String(&quot;trace_id&quot;, span.SpanContext().TraceID().String()),&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">logger </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slog.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">New</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(slog.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">NewJSONHandler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(os.Stdout, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">slog</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">HandlerOptions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Level: slog.LevelInfo,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">logger.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Info</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order processed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    slog.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ORD-2026-1234\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    slog.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"items_count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    slog.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Duration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"latency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">45</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">time.Millisecond),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    slog.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"trace_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SpanContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">TraceID</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>输出：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;time&quot;: &quot;2026-07-18T10:15:30.045Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;level&quot;: &quot;INFO&quot;,&#10;  &quot;msg&quot;: &quot;order processed&quot;,&#10;  &quot;order_id&quot;: &quot;ORD-2026-1234&quot;,&#10;  &quot;items_count&quot;: 3,&#10;  &quot;latency&quot;: &quot;45ms&quot;,&#10;  &quot;trace_id&quot;: &quot;4bf92f3577b34da6a3ce929d0e0e4736&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"time\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-07-18T10:15:30.045Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"INFO\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"msg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order processed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"order_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ORD-2026-1234\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"items_count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"latency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"45ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"trace_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"4bf92f3577b34da6a3ce929d0e0e4736\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>slog</code> 通过 <code>Handler</code> 接口与 OTel Log Bridge 对接——<code>go.opentelemetry.io/contrib/bridges/otelslog</code> 将 slog 输出自动路由到 OTel Collector，无需改动业务代码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反模式清单\">反模式清单</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反模式</th>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>修复方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>消息模板塞满变量 <code>fmt.Sprintf(&quot;user %s did %s on %s at %s&quot;, ...)</code></td>\n<td>无法按字段过滤</td>\n<td>用 key-value 参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高基数值做 label（如 <code>user_id</code> 做 Loki stream label）</td>\n<td>索引爆炸</td>\n<td>降为 structured metadata</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日志里记录完整请求/响应 body</td>\n<td>存储膨胀 + PII 泄露</td>\n<td>采样 + 脱敏 + 截断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多行日志（Java stack trace 作为独立行）</td>\n<td>管道中每行被切分为独立事件</td>\n<td>多行合并策略（multiline parser）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间戳格式不统一</td>\n<td>跨服务排序失败</td>\n<td>统一 RFC 3339 纳秒精度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"从自由文本迁移的渐进策略\">从自由文本迁移的渐进策略</h2><p>大规模迁移到结构化日志不是一次性的&quot;推倒重写&quot;。推荐的渐进路径：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>新服务强制结构化</strong>：新项目从第一行代码就使用结构化日志库</li>\n<li><strong>旧服务加 Bridge</strong>：通过 OTel Log Bridge 或 Fluentd/Fluent Bit 的解析器，在管道中将旧格式转化为结构化</li>\n<li><strong>统一时间戳</strong>：全链路使用 UTC + RFC 3339 with nanosecond</li>\n<li><strong>注入 trace context</strong>：通过 OTel auto-instrumentation 自动将 trace_id/span_id 注入已有日志</li>\n<li><strong>逐步下线自由文本</strong>：当结构化覆盖率达到 95%+ 后，关闭非结构化日志的索引通路</li>\n</ol>\n<p>迁移过程中，管道层的<a href=\"../pipeline/log-parsing-enrichment\">日志解析与富化</a>能力是关键桥梁——它让非结构化遗留日志也能参与统一查询，为完全迁移赢得时间。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>结构化日志是现代日志工程的基石。从 OTel Log Data Model 的 GA 标准到 Go slog 的语言原生支持，工具链已经成熟。关键设计决策集中在 Schema 分层（控制基数）、Bridge 模式（渐进迁移）和源头脱敏（安全合规）三个维度。下一步是理解<a href=\"log-levels-taxonomy\">日志级别与分类</a>如何在结构化的基础上进一步控制日志的信噪比。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"结构化日志设计","id":"结构化日志设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从文本到结构：范式转换的工程动因","id":"从文本到结构-范式转换的工程动因"},{"level":2,"text":"OpenTelemetry Log Data Model：2026 的事实标准","id":"opentelemetry-log-data-model-2026-的事实标准"},{"level":2,"text":"Schema 设计原则：平衡可查询性与噪声","id":"schema-设计原则-平衡可查询性与噪声"},{"level":3,"text":"三层 Schema 架构","id":"三层-schema-架构"},{"level":3,"text":"基数控制的量化标准","id":"基数控制的量化标准"},{"level":2,"text":"语言实践：Go slog 的结构化日志实现","id":"语言实践-go-slog-的结构化日志实现"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式清单","id":"反模式清单"},{"level":2,"text":"从自由文本迁移的渐进策略","id":"从自由文本迁移的渐进策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"日志级别与分类体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/fundamentals/log-levels-taxonomy"}}